OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to do if your child is being
OL,4,Astalked online
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir advice follows the case of a
OL,7,FWiltshire teenager who became
OL,8,F"obsessed" with a girl after a five-day
OL,9,Frelationship, monitoring her online
OL,10,Factivity and creating fake social media
OL,11,Faccounts after she blocked him before
OL,12,Flater attacking her with a knife.
OL,14,FIt also comes as stalking offences have
OL,15,Frisen across Avon and Somerset, with
OL,16,Fpolice recording 1,348 offences last
OL,17,Fyear, up from 954 two years earlier.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
